oroborus for Debian
-------------------

UPDATE: Oroborus is now maintained by Stefan Pfetzing <dreamind@dreamind.de>.

Oroborus does not have a menu of any kind. This is why I suggest you install
the package 'deskmenu'. It allows for a root menu at the click of a mouse and
is fairly configureable. Sometimes a menu is useful ;)

 -- Stefan Pfetzing <dreamind@dreamind.de>, Fri, 24 May 2002 00:00:53 +0200
